      "message": "I\u0027m sorry to backseat drive but is this what we wanted, checking expectations twice? \n\nIn an case, can this code be deduplicated with `ResolveExpectations`? Something like\n\n```\n// PSUEDO CODE\nvoid DawnBaseTest::ResolveExpectations() {\n      for (const auto\u0026 expectation : mDeferredExpectations) {\n         ...\n         CheckExpecation(expectation, dataFromFirstRun)\n      }\n}\n\nvoid DawnBaseTest::ResolveReplayExpectations() {\n      for (const auto\u0026 expectation : mReplayRedabacks) {\n         ...\n         CheckExpecation(expectation, dataFromReacback)\n      }\n}\n```\n\nThey seem like they should be the same to me. The only difference is which buffer is mapped.",
      "revId": "01851643be4eabfbc7610f577aa086f8fb8d523c",
